{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>והורדתם</b> Two times in the Masorah: this one and the other והורדתם את אבי הנה. Parable: a cow that does not want to enter to slaughter — they bring in her calf and she enters. So too Jacob did not want to go down to Egypt, and when he heard that Joseph was there he entered immediately."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:22.731919427Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}